WEBVTT

00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:09.940
Futaba-chan!

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:16.070
The donuts at the shop in front of 
the station are 100 yen now, right?

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:18.990
Want to stop by there with me today?

00:00:20.090 --> 00:00:21.110
Yuuri...

00:00:25.790 --> 00:00:26.460
Yeah.

00:00:27.450 --> 00:00:31.260
<i>Today, I might...</i>

00:00:32.770 --> 00:00:34.410
<i>...lose a precious friend.</i>

00:02:13.210 --> 00:02:17.880
<i>Today, no matter what, I will definitely, 
definitely tell Yuuri properly!</i>

00:02:19.630 --> 00:02:25.780
<i>But still... I bet I'll still lose my nerve 
when it comes down to it.</i>

00:02:26.210 --> 00:02:27.940
<i>Okay, here's how it is.</i>

00:02:27.940 --> 00:02:31.290
<i>No matter what happens, if I don't tell 
her today, I'll give myself a crew cut!</i>

00:02:31.510 --> 00:02:32.430
<i>I've decided!</i>

00:02:34.030 --> 00:02:35.320
It's Murao-san!

00:02:36.060 --> 00:02:38.120
Shall we invite Murao-san, too?

00:02:38.120 --> 00:02:38.950
What?

00:02:38.950 --> 00:02:40.130
Murao-san!

00:02:40.130 --> 00:02:41.680
Hey, wait!

00:02:41.920 --> 00:02:45.980
<i>Are you saying I have to talk 
about this in front of Murao-san?!</i>

00:02:47.490 --> 00:02:51.310
But I decided I'd give myself a 
crew cut if I don't tell her today.

00:02:51.760 --> 00:02:55.510
If I don't tell her now, I don't think 
I'll ever be able to tell her.

00:02:58.030 --> 00:03:00.950
You're seriously hanging out 
with Makita Yuuri?

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:02.720
Asumi...

00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:06.240
Yes?

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:07.920
L-Listen...

00:03:07.920 --> 00:03:10.430
The donuts at the station are 100 yen today!

00:03:10.860 --> 00:03:12.290
Want to come?

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:13.070
What?

00:03:13.070 --> 00:03:15.670
With me and Futaba-chan, that is.

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:17.760
Why?

00:03:19.190 --> 00:03:21.180
Oh, sorry, it's so sudden.

00:03:21.180 --> 00:03:24.640
I bet you have things to do. Right?

00:03:27.070 --> 00:03:29.270
I'm actually free...

00:03:31.930 --> 00:03:34.460
You sure have changed.

00:03:36.690 --> 00:03:37.680
Thanks.

00:03:39.090 --> 00:03:42.190
I wanted to change, after all.

00:03:42.190 --> 00:03:45.240
So, I'm going to take that as a compliment!

00:03:47.100 --> 00:03:48.440
I see.

00:03:50.340 --> 00:03:55.760
<i>Back then, I was so desperate to be liked 
that I never said how I really felt.</i>

00:03:56.880 --> 00:04:00.840
<i>Kou said I had "friends in name only."
 He made fun of me for that.</i>

00:04:04.820 --> 00:04:08.040
<i>I'm not like how I was back then.</i>

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:11.180
<i>I really have changed!</i>

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:13.270
Futaba-chan!

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:20.940
<i>Yuuri's not "in name only." 
She's a real friend I care about.</i>

00:04:17.060 --> 00:04:20.940
Murao-san said she'd come! Let's go!

00:04:21.850 --> 00:04:26.380
<i>And it's because I care that 
I want to be honest with her.</i>

00:04:32.560 --> 00:04:33.790
<i>But...!</i>

00:04:34.160 --> 00:04:37.540
Look at this! I borrowed it
 from Mabuchi-kun today!

00:04:37.930 --> 00:04:39.010
Isn't that great?

00:04:39.010 --> 00:04:42.670
<i>It's so hard to find the 
right time to say it!</i>

00:04:45.290 --> 00:04:46.770
<i>If I don't tell her, I get a crew cut.</i>

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:51.310
<i>But I'm scared. I'm scared to tell her.</i>

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:54.270
Yuu—

00:04:55.540 --> 00:04:57.230
Are you okay?

00:04:57.230 --> 00:05:00.570
I-I'm sorry! It didn't get on you, did it?

00:05:02.510 --> 00:05:04.200
<i>My heart feels like it's going to break...</i>

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:08.200
<i>But...</i>

00:05:10.030 --> 00:05:10.820
Yuuri.

00:05:12.200 --> 00:05:17.590
There's something I have to tell you.

00:05:19.810 --> 00:05:20.840
Um...

00:05:25.930 --> 00:05:27.740
The truth is, I...

00:05:31.130 --> 00:05:36.650
I... love Kou, too.

00:05:41.220 --> 00:05:43.730
I fell in love with the same person as you.

00:05:44.410 --> 00:05:45.090
I'm sorry.

00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:52.410
You, too, Futaba-chan?!

00:05:54.010 --> 00:05:56.720
It's because Mabuchi-kun's so hot, right?

00:05:56.720 --> 00:05:58.340
Right? Right?

00:05:58.340 --> 00:06:00.920
Are you two blind or something?

00:06:01.190 --> 00:06:03.920
What? He's hot!

00:06:03.050 --> 00:06:03.920
<i>What?</i>

00:06:04.620 --> 00:06:06.770
What's wrong with Mabuchi-kun?

00:06:04.620 --> 00:06:08.130
<i>D-Does this kind of thing happen?</i>

00:06:06.770 --> 00:06:08.880
The fact that he's a brat.

00:06:09.430 --> 00:06:12.410
<i>Then I could have told her a lot earlier!</i>

00:06:12.910 --> 00:06:18.270
Oh, but in that case... 
you're so much closer to Mabuchi-kun.

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:20.060
I'm at a disadvantage.

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:22.330
That's not true! It's fine!

00:06:22.880 --> 00:06:27.120
Kou's already told me 
he doesn't like me like that.

00:06:27.120 --> 00:06:30.280
What? Futaba-chan, did you 
already confess to him?!

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:38.830
Oh, no, I didn't. It's just that it was mutual 
back in middle school, but...

00:06:41.640 --> 00:06:43.000
When I saw him again,

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:47.330
Kou was really clear about the 
fact that that was in the past.

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:49.310
I see...

00:06:51.500 --> 00:06:57.590
At first, I also thought I didn't like Kou
 the way he is now, but...

00:07:01.790 --> 00:07:03.110
I see!

00:07:03.730 --> 00:07:08.070
So from now on, whoever succeeds, 
no hard feelings on either side, okay?

00:07:13.980 --> 00:07:15.060
Yeah.

00:07:16.300 --> 00:07:19.100
Oh! I have to go to the bathroom.

00:07:30.110 --> 00:07:32.530
That was scary...

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:38.420
Yoshioka-san?

00:07:39.440 --> 00:07:46.330
I knew I had to tell her... 
but it was so hard to do it.

00:07:48.180 --> 00:07:49.740
I finally managed to tell her.

00:07:57.970 --> 00:08:00.620
Futaba-chan likes Mabuchi-kun, too?

00:08:05.010 --> 00:08:09.160
We've fallen in love with the same person...

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:16.540
But... I'm sure she must have 
been scared to tell me, right?

00:08:26.200 --> 00:08:30.400
<i>Let's both be in love with him,
 fair and square.</i>

00:08:42.650 --> 00:08:43.900
I'm back!

00:08:44.510 --> 00:08:46.060
W-Welcome back!

00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:53.260
Oh, I finished my drink!

00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:53.260
<i>Yuuri. Her eyes are red...</i>

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:58.160
<i>Was she in the bathroom... crying?</i>

00:09:02.510 --> 00:09:03.350
I...

00:09:03.790 --> 00:09:07.480
I love Tanaka-sensei.

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:10.490
What?! Where did that come from?!

00:09:11.680 --> 00:09:14.860
What? You don't look surprised.

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:17.070
Is it possible, Yuuri, that you knew?

00:09:19.040 --> 00:09:20.170
Um...

00:09:21.070 --> 00:09:25.900
I didn't want to tell her. 
She just happened to find out.

00:09:26.970 --> 00:09:31.470
I was afraid she might tell you,
 Yoshioka-san...

00:09:37.960 --> 00:09:40.240
But I guess she really kept the secret.

00:09:44.210 --> 00:09:46.390
Makita-san is a good person, you know?

00:09:47.870 --> 00:09:50.860
You knew that, too, Yoshioka-san.

00:09:50.860 --> 00:09:52.650
That's why you worked so hard

00:09:52.650 --> 00:09:54.330
to say something that was
 hard for you to say, right?

00:09:59.930 --> 00:10:07.790
Watching the two of you, I started thinking, 
maybe it's okay if they know who I like.

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:09.740
That's why I said it.

00:10:12.390 --> 00:10:16.060
The truth is, this is the first time

00:10:16.060 --> 00:10:19.970
I've hung out with anyone 
since I got into high school.

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:22.700
Murao-san...

00:10:25.070 --> 00:10:28.890
Well anyway, it's Mabuchi who'll be 
making the decision in the end.

00:10:29.980 --> 00:10:33.730
You two snarling at each other 
won't affect anything.

00:10:34.170 --> 00:10:37.690
And in the end, 
he might reject both of you!

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:40.800
That's true...

00:10:41.840 --> 00:10:45.020
But even if things go better for one of you,

00:10:45.850 --> 00:10:49.420
I'll always remain neutral, so...

00:10:50.140 --> 00:10:52.090
Go for it, both of you.

00:10:54.030 --> 00:10:55.450
Yeah, I will!

00:10:55.450 --> 00:10:56.950
Thanks!

00:10:56.950 --> 00:11:00.460
But you two really do have awful taste.

00:11:10.290 --> 00:11:10.980
Hm?

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:18.840
Murao!

00:11:20.990 --> 00:11:25.150
Did you say you're not coming 
to the after-test karaoke party?

00:11:25.150 --> 00:11:25.870
Yeah.

00:11:26.550 --> 00:11:29.380
You're skipping out on 
all class get-togethers.

00:11:29.380 --> 00:11:30.660
You should at least come to one.

00:11:32.440 --> 00:11:34.000
I don't feel like going.

00:11:34.300 --> 00:11:37.390
I don't want to remember anything 
about my current class.

00:11:38.440 --> 00:11:38.960
But...

00:11:41.210 --> 00:11:43.460
It has nothing to do with you, Kominato-kun.

00:12:02.050 --> 00:12:05.900
Shuuei Line - Sakigatani Station

00:12:06.190 --> 00:12:08.870
Oh, it's dark already.

00:12:09.380 --> 00:12:11.830
Girl talk is an amazing thing.

00:12:12.310 --> 00:12:14.230
I'm glad I saw it through.

00:12:15.300 --> 00:12:17.960
Now I can get close to Kou if I want to.

00:12:23.420 --> 00:12:24.690
Kou?

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:28.410
<i>Whoa! All of a sudden, at a time like this?</i>

00:12:29.200 --> 00:12:31.620
<i>I need to prepare myself!</i>

00:12:32.970 --> 00:12:33.720
<i>Okay!</i>

00:12:38.200 --> 00:12:39.030
Kou?

00:12:39.660 --> 00:12:40.660
Hey.

00:12:40.660 --> 00:12:43.110
Oh, it's that cat!

00:12:43.490 --> 00:12:46.230
He seems to live in this area.

00:12:48.060 --> 00:12:50.190
Looks like he's a little thinner 
than before, don't you think?

00:12:50.730 --> 00:12:53.120
I wonder if he's getting enough to eat.

00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:56.500
If you're worried, why don't you take him in?

00:12:56.780 --> 00:13:00.580
No way. If I take him home, 
I'll start to care for him.

00:13:01.790 --> 00:13:04.220
So why not just care for him, then?

00:13:05.690 --> 00:13:11.260
Caring for things brings a lot of trouble.

00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:17.400
Later.

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:19.610
You're taking a train?

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:22.390
Where are you going at this hour?

00:13:22.390 --> 00:13:23.820
It's a secret.

00:13:28.730 --> 00:13:34.260
Caring for things brings a lot of trouble.

00:13:36.220 --> 00:13:42.180
So... Kou doesn't care about school, 
or his friends, either?

00:13:45.370 --> 00:13:47.130
<i>Hearing something like that...</i>

00:13:50.080 --> 00:13:51.250
<i>It makes me anxious.</i>

00:14:05.370 --> 00:14:10.370
<i>I followed him impulsively, 
but... where could he be going?</i>

00:14:19.120 --> 00:14:19.850
<i>He got off!</i>

00:14:58.290 --> 00:15:01.260
<i>What? What is this place?</i>

00:15:01.260 --> 00:15:03.280
<i>There are teenagers everywhere.</i>

00:15:04.770 --> 00:15:06.120
Hey, Kou!

00:15:06.120 --> 00:15:06.810
Hey.

00:15:08.660 --> 00:15:12.670
<i>Kou? He knows the people here?</i>

00:15:13.900 --> 00:15:14.900
<i>Why?</i>

00:15:15.860 --> 00:15:21.550
<i>Kou looks like a person from 
another world. I don't like it.</i>

00:15:26.990 --> 00:15:28.530
What are you doing?

00:15:28.770 --> 00:15:31.110
That's my line! What are <i>you</i> doing?

00:15:32.340 --> 00:15:35.450
Where did that come from? 
Why are you mad at me?

00:15:35.870 --> 00:15:39.170
Well, because... um...

00:15:42.150 --> 00:15:45.590
It's almost midterms! 
Shouldn't you be studying?!

00:15:42.680 --> 00:15:43.010
<b>Doing her best to argue</b>

00:15:43.310 --> 00:15:43.650
<b>Doing her best to argue</b>

00:15:43.940 --> 00:15:44.270
<b>Doing her best to argue</b>

00:15:44.560 --> 00:15:44.690
<b>Doing her best to argue</b>

00:15:47.800 --> 00:15:51.690
Kou-kun! You gotta study 
for your tests, you know!

00:15:52.750 --> 00:15:53.830
Girlfriend?

00:15:53.830 --> 00:15:54.800
No way.

00:15:55.300 --> 00:15:59.880
Then can I put the moves on her?
 She's got a nice face.

00:16:01.330 --> 00:16:04.370
She's seriously sloppy, 
she eats more than I do,

00:16:04.370 --> 00:16:08.020
she's got chubby legs, and she 
doesn't have a trace of femininity.

00:16:08.020 --> 00:16:10.340
What? What was that?

00:16:10.340 --> 00:16:12.860
Oh? She looks pretty feminine to me.

00:16:12.860 --> 00:16:14.970
Hey, sister!

00:16:14.970 --> 00:16:16.740
What? Who are you?

00:16:17.160 --> 00:16:19.790
I bet she's got it where it counts...

00:16:20.030 --> 00:16:21.380
Who are you with?

00:16:21.380 --> 00:16:22.830
Um, well...

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:24.790
Tits.

00:16:30.270 --> 00:16:35.180
To hear that from a friend... 
you make me sick.

00:16:36.270 --> 00:16:39.060
Sorry. I'm going home for today.

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:07.380
Turn right here, and you'll 
see the sign for the station.

00:17:07.690 --> 00:17:09.420
Huh? What about you?

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:10.810
You aren't going to the station?

00:17:47.060 --> 00:17:49.040
Stop following me already!

00:18:00.480 --> 00:18:03.180
But... I just can't stand it!

00:18:06.250 --> 00:18:12.270
It's like I haven't really gotten closer 
to Kou at all. I can't stand that.

00:18:38.130 --> 00:18:39.490
Thanks.

00:18:43.450 --> 00:18:46.900
Those people from before. 
What were they like?

00:18:46.900 --> 00:18:49.230
I don't really know.

00:18:49.690 --> 00:18:52.830
You go there a lot? How come?

00:18:52.830 --> 00:18:55.940
I just started doing it. It kills time.

00:19:00.670 --> 00:19:03.260
Do you do bad things, Kou?

00:19:05.230 --> 00:19:07.250
You mean like drinking and smoking?

00:19:11.430 --> 00:19:14.190
Well, some guys do it.

00:19:17.100 --> 00:19:19.170
I don't, though.

00:19:19.970 --> 00:19:22.010
I don't want to, for one thing.

00:19:23.730 --> 00:19:25.430
I really just talk.

00:19:32.860 --> 00:19:35.940
If you want someone to talk to,
 you could talk to me.

00:19:39.620 --> 00:19:42.680
Y-You know, people like me, 
and Kominato-kun, and Yuuri!

00:19:42.680 --> 00:19:44.660
Anyway, lots of people!

00:19:45.000 --> 00:19:49.440
Anyway, looks like you're the one 
who's got "friends in name only."

00:19:49.440 --> 00:19:50.900
I'm turning that back on you.

00:19:54.260 --> 00:19:59.960
Aren't you letting your guard down 
too much? You could get assaulted.

00:19:59.960 --> 00:20:03.460
Wh-What are you talking about?

00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:08.180
I know you don't see me that way.

00:20:08.600 --> 00:20:12.480
Besides, I know you wouldn't 
do something like that.

00:20:13.020 --> 00:20:14.440
It's fi—

00:20:19.510 --> 00:20:21.610
You take men too lightly.

00:20:21.950 --> 00:20:24.010
You're a lot weaker, for one thing.

00:20:26.170 --> 00:20:32.140
Even if a man doesn't particularly 
care for a woman, he can assault her.

00:20:43.080 --> 00:20:43.550
Ow.

00:20:43.990 --> 00:20:46.050
Well? Scary, wasn't it?

00:20:47.030 --> 00:20:48.090
You flicked my forehead?

00:20:48.800 --> 00:20:54.090
The only reason you weren't assaulted is 
because you happened to be with me, okay?

00:20:55.690 --> 00:20:57.980
If you don't want scary memories like this,

00:20:58.910 --> 00:21:01.280
you shouldn't go to places 
like that by yourself.

00:21:03.150 --> 00:21:05.150
<i>D-Does that mean...</i>

00:21:05.680 --> 00:21:08.890
<i>He did that just to make me understand?</i>

00:21:15.100 --> 00:21:17.080
What? Are you crying?

00:21:20.600 --> 00:21:23.820
Sorry. I frightened you too much.

00:21:25.580 --> 00:21:28.690
<i>I was shocked. And frightened.</i>

00:21:29.980 --> 00:21:33.960
<i>But that's not the only reason I'm crying.</i>

00:21:33.960 --> 00:21:35.460
I said I was sorry.

00:21:37.050 --> 00:21:44.180
<i>It's more because I'm embarrassed 
over how excited I got.</i>

00:21:47.500 --> 00:21:52.170
<i>But I'm keeping that a secret from Kou.</i>

00:23:26.000 --> 00:23:41.020
Next Episode . . .

00:23:29.380 --> 00:23:33.400
I guess he's got friends 
who worry about him now, huh?

00:23:35.120 --> 00:23:38.490
I'm sure he'll work his hardest 
for all of you, too.
